# Site Config

## Page locations

- Portal / auth HTML: `pages/portal/`, `pages/login/`, `pages/reset-password/`
- Legacy `/portal/*.html` and `/auth/*` are redirects to `pages/…`
- Admin: `admin/`
- Public events: `events/`
- Shared shell: `js/components/pageShell/`
- Theme: `theme/Theme_JMLLC001/`

## Shell pages

Include placeholders and `shared.css`:

- `#nav-placeholder`
- `#footer-placeholder`
- `#tabs-placeholder` (portal mobile)

Set `data-page-type="portal"` or `"admin"` and `data-active-page` as needed.

## Cache / deploy

After visual or SW asset changes, bump `CACHE_NAME` in `sw.js` and use `?v=` on critical CSS/JS when Cloudflare may serve stale paths.

## Copy / chrome

Navigation labels, footer, and chrome copy should stay consistent across portal and admin. Prefer existing pageShell render helpers over one-off hardcoded nav strings.

## Docs layout

- Product: `docs/product/` (`todo.md`, `audits/`, `improvements/`, `systems/`)
- Business: `docs/business/` (`strategy/`, `ventures/`, `ideas/`)
- Legal: `docs/legal/official/`
- Index: `docs/README.md`
- Visual theme reference: `pages/style-guide/index.html`
